  "added_at": "2026-11-10T10:38:02Z",
  "title": "Ecommerce Marketing Is Not What It Used To Be",
  "author": "Max Sturtevant",
  "posted_at": "20260609",
  "views": 6262,
  "text": "Book a call to work with me: https://calendly.com/maxwellcopy/discovery-meeting\n\nMaster email marketing by joining my course + community: https://www.skool.com/email-marketerz/about\n\nFree docs and guides: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1VJXrkfB6kOaU3Qgqih2Sk9M6yiNmU9QO5Q_CNSmtNIw/edit?tab=t.0\n\nCompany website: https://www.wellcopy.net/\n\nJoin my team: https://www.wellcopy.net/careers\n\nCasper. Allbirds. Outdoor Voices. Away.\n\nBillion-dollar brands. All dead or dying.\n\nThe playbook that built them stopped working, and most brands running it right now don't even know it yet.\n\nIn this video, I'm breaking down exactly what broke, what replaced it, and why the brands winning right now are playing a completely different game.\n\nIf you're new to my channel, my name is Max Sturtevant. I'm the founder and CEO of Wellcopy, a premium email marketing agency helping 7-9 figure brands scale with email. \n\nHow I got here\u2026\n\n2019 - Started my first business flipping sports cards online.\n2020 - Transitioned into copywriting, then email marketing.\n2021- Became head email marketer at multiple 8-figure e-commerce brands\n2023 - Started Wellcopy with 3 clients, bringing those in-house systems to the agency level.\n2023 - By year-end, scaled to 8 clients.\n2024 - Grew to 30 clients, crossing into 7-figures.\n2025 - Now serving 100+ clients and generated over $200 million in total revenue for our brands\n\nWhat you'll learn on this channel: \n\nEverything I teach is grounded in real email campaigns with real numbers from 7, 8, and 9-figure brands. \n\nMy mission with this channel is to make the advanced email marketing playbook accessible to everyone so you don't have to spend years figuring it out like I did.\n\nLet's grow,\n\n-Max",
